sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Request A · Django worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL · same course row
    participant B as Request B · Django worker
    Note over A,B: Both authorized and eligible · capacity 1 · no enrolled students or older waiters
    A->>DB: BEGIN · SELECT course FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>A: Row lock acquired
    B->>DB: BEGIN · SELECT the same course FOR UPDATE
    Note over DB,B: B waits while A holds the lock
    A->>DB: Check eligibility and count active enrollments
    DB-->>A: Active count = 0
    A->>DB: Save A as ENROLLED and write CHANGE event
    A->>DB: COMMIT · release the lock
    DB-->>B: Row lock acquired after A commits
    B->>DB: Check eligibility and count active enrollments
    DB-->>B: Active count = 1
    B->>DB: Save B as WAITLISTED and write CHANGE event
    B->>DB: COMMIT · release the lock
    Note over A,B: One enrolled student · one waiting student · capacity remains 1
